'''Joshua Max Brener''' (born [[October 1]], [[1984]]) is an American actor who voices [[Erskin Semaj]] in ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]'' and [[Neeku Vozo]] in ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]''. He was known for playing Dale in [[Wikipedia:The Big Bang Theory|''The Big Bang Theory'']].

He is married to [[Meghan Falcone]], who plays [[Nenavakasa Nalor]] in ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]''.<ref>{{SW|url=news/buckets-list-extra-the-engineer-star-wars-resistance|text=Bucket's List Extra: 5 Fun Facts from "The Engineer" &ndash; ''Star Wars Resistance''}}</ref>

